@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .@prefix era: <http://data.europa.eu/949/> .@prefix era-sh: <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/> .@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .@prefix estur: <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/def/core#> .@prefix rdf4j: <http://rdf4j.org/schema/rdf4j#> .@prefix sesame: <http://www.openrdf.org/schema/sesame#> .@prefix fn: <http://www.w3.org/2005/xpath-functions#> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentShape> sh:property    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentAccommodationRatingSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentAccommodationRateTypeSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentAccommodationUnitCategorySKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasAdditionalAccommodationServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasAdditionalPetAccommodationServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasPriceClassSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentAccommodationRatingSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Grading or classification scheme system providing an assessment of the facilities, services or both provided by tourist accommodation. Typically within five categories, often indicated by one to five symbols."@en,    "Sistema de clasificación o categorización que evalúa las instalaciones, los servicios o ambos aspectos de los alojamientos turísticos. Normalmente se divide en cinco categorías, que suelen indicarse con uno a cinco símbolos."@es;  sh:path estur:accommodationRating;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentAccommodationRatingSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "accommodationRating: The instance of AccommodationEstablishment has a accommodationRating value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentAccommodationRatingSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AccommodationRatingSystem>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "accommodationRating: The instance of AccommodationEstablishment has a accommodationRating value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AccommodationRatingSystem."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RulesAndTipsShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RulesAndTipsAdversityTypeSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RulesAndTipsAdversityTypeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A situation or event characterized by significant misfortune, lasting over a period of time and involving a varying degree of severity."@en,    "Situación o suceso con un fuerte componente de infortunio, una cierta duración en el tiempo y con un mayor o menor grado de gravedad."@es;  sh:path estur:adversityType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RulesAndTipsAdversityTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "adversityType: The instance of RulesAndTips has a adversityType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RulesAndTipsAdversityTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdversityType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "adversityType: The instance of RulesAndTips has a adversityType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdversityType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceShape> sh:property    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceRelatedProductSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceTypeSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceRelatedProductSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "An agri-food product linked to an agrotourism experience."@en, "Producto agroalimentario vinculado con una experiencia agroturística."@es;  sh:path estur:agrotourismExperienceRelatedProduct;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceRelatedProductSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "agrotourismExperienceRelatedProduct: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a agrotourismExperienceRelatedProduct value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceRelatedProductSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AgrotourismExperienceRelatedProduct>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "agrotourismExperienceRelatedProduct: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a agrotourismExperienceRelatedProduct value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AgrotourismExperienceRelatedProduct."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceTypeSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Naturaleza o temática de la experiencia agroturística ofrecida, en función de las actividades desarrolladas."@es,    "Nature or theme of the agrotourism experience offered, based on the activities carried out. "@en;  sh:path estur:agrotourismExperienceType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "agrotourismExperienceType: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a agrotourismExperienceType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceAgrotourismExperienceTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AgrotourismExperienceType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "agrotourismExperienceType: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a agrotourismExperienceType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AgrotourismExperienceType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/BeachShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/BeachBeachTypeSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/BeachHasBeachServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/BeachBeachTypeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Diferentes categorías o clasificaciones que se utilizan para describir y diferenciar las playas según sus características físicas y ambientales."@es,    "Different categories or classifications used to describe and distinguish beaches according to their physical and environmental characteristics."@en;  sh:path estur:beachType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/BeachBeachTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "beachType: The instance of Beach has a beachType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/BeachBeachTypeSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/BeachType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "beachType: The instance of Beach has a beachType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/BeachType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByDaySKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByMonthSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByDaySKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Indica los días específicos de la semana en los que la programación de un evento, servicio o propuesta especial se realiza de forma recurrente (por ejemplo, lunes y martes)"@es,    "Indicates the specific days of the week on which the schedule for an event, service, or special offer takes place on a recurring basis (for example, Monday and Tuesday)."@en;  sh:path estur:byDay;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByDaySKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "byDay: The instance of Schedule has a byDay value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByDaySKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/DayOfTheWeek>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "byDay: The instance of Schedule has a byDay value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/DayOfTheWeek."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByMonthSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Indica el mes o los meses específicos del calendario en los que la programación de un evento, servicio o propuesta especial se realiza de forma recurrente."@es,    "Indicates the specific month or months of the calendar in which the scheduling of an event, service, or special offer takes place on a recurring basis."@en;  sh:path estur:byMonth;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByMonthSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "byMonth: The instance of Schedule has a byMonth value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/ScheduleByMonthSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MonthOfTheYear>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "byMonth: The instance of Schedule has a byMonth value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MonthOfTheYear."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/CertificationShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/CertificationCertificationTypeSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/CertificationCertificationTypeSKOS> a    sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "List of relevant national and international tourism certifications for events, destinations, tourism resources, public services, and tourism organisations, including their facilities and services."@en,    "Listado de certificaciones turísticas de referencia en el ámbito nacional e internacional para eventos, destinos, recursos turísticos, servicios públicos y empresas turísticas, incluyendo sus instalaciones y servicios."@es;  sh:path estur:certificationType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/CertificationCertificationTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "certificationType: The instance of Certification has a certificationType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/CertificationCertificationTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CertificationType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "certificationType: The instance of Certification has a certificationType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CertificationType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicyShape> sh:property    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicyCompulsoryZoosanitaryProductSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicySpeciesSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicyCompulsoryZoosanitaryProductSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Substances, active ingredients, formulations or preparations intended for the diagnosis, prevention, treatment, alleviation or cure of diseases or ailments in animals, and whose administration is required for admission."@en,    "Sustancias, ingredientes activos, formulaciones o preparados destinados al diagnóstico, prevención, tratamiento, alivio o cura de las enfermedades o dolencias de los animales, y cuya administración es requerida para su admisión."@es;  sh:path estur:compulsoryZoosanitaryProduct;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicyCompulsoryZoosanitaryProductSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "compulsoryZoosanitaryProduct: The instance of PetAdmissionPolicy has a compulsoryZoosanitaryProduct value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicyCompulsoryZoosanitaryProductSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CompulsoryZoosanitaryProduct>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "compulsoryZoosanitaryProduct: The instance of PetAdmissionPolicy has a compulsoryZoosanitaryProduct value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CompulsoryZoosanitaryProduct."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/OpeningHoursShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/OpeningHoursDayOfTheWeekSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/OpeningHoursDayOfTheWeekSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "One of the seven named periods (Monday through Sunday) that constitute a standard weekly cycle, used to define recurring time slots."@en,    "Uno de los siete periodos nombrados (de lunes a domingo) que constituyen un ciclo semanal estándar, utilizado para definir franjas horarias recurrentes."@es;  sh:path estur:dayOfTheWeek;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/OpeningHoursDayOfTheWeekSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "dayOfTheWeek: The instance of OpeningHours has a dayOfTheWeek value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/OpeningHoursDayOfTheWeekSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/DayOfTheWeek>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "dayOfTheWeek: The instance of OpeningHours has a dayOfTheWeek value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/DayOfTheWeek."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismDestinationShape> sh:property    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismDestinationDestinationTypeSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismDestinationDestinationTypeSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Categorisation of the space according to its main characteristics and attractions."@en,    "Categorización del espacio en función de sus características y atractivos principales."@es;  sh:path estur:destinationType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismDestinationDestinationTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "destinationType: The instance of TourismDestination has a destinationType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismDestinationDestinationTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/DestinationType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "destinationType: The instance of TourismDestination has a destinationType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/DestinationType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventEventTypeSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventHasAdditionalEventServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventAvailableLanguageSKOS>, <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventHasTagSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTouristTypeSKOS>, <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTravelUnitSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventEventTypeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Clasificación utilizada para agrupar jerárquicamente los diferentes tipos de eventos que se llevan a cabo en función de su naturaleza o temática."@es,    "Classification used to hierarchically group the different types of events that take place according to their nature or theme."@en;  sh:path estur:eventType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventEventTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "eventType: The instance of Event has a eventType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventEventTypeSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/EventType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "eventType: The instance of Event has a eventType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/EventType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HandicraftsShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HandicraftsHandicraftsTypeSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HandicraftsHandicraftsTypeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Categorisation of handicraft shops according to the type of product they offer"@en,    "Categorización de las tiendas de artesanías en función del tipo de producto que ofrece."@es;  sh:path estur:handicraftsType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HandicraftsHandicraftsTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "handicraftsType: The instance of Handicrafts has a handicraftsType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HandicraftsHandicraftsTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/HandicraftsType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "handicraftsType: The instance of Handicrafts has a handicraftsType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/HandicraftsType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur