nce of AgrotourismExperience has a timeOfTheYear value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TimeOfTheYear>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "timeOfTheYear: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a timeOfTheYear value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TimeOfTheYear."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTourSpecialtySKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Enfoque particular o características únicas que distinguen al servicio de visita guiada."@es,    "Particular focus or unique features that distinguish the tour service."@en;  sh:path estur:tourSpecialty;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTourSpecialtySKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "tourSpecialty: The instance of Tour has a tourSpecialty value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTourSpecialtySKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TourSpecialty>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "tourSpecialty: The instance of Tour has a tourSpecialty value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TourSpecialty."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTouristTypeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Clasificación para eventos, propuestas especiales, destinos y organizaciones turísticas, instalaciones turísticas o vinculadas, recursos y servicios turísticos en función de sus turistas objetivo con relación a sus motivaciones principales de viaje."@es,    """Classification for events, special offers, destinations and
tourism organisations, tourism or related facilities, tourism resources and services based on their target tourists in relation to their main travel motivations."""@en;  sh:path estur:touristType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTouristTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "touristType: The instance of Event has a touristType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTouristTypeSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TouristType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "touristType: The instance of Event has a touristType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TouristType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTravelUnitSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Clasificación de eventos, propuestas especiales, destinos y organizaciones turísticas, instalaciones turísticas o relacionadas, recursos y servicios turísticos en función de sus turistas objetivo con relación a la composición del grupo con el que viajan y comparten los gastos asociados."@es,    "Classification for events, special offers, tourism destinations and organisations, tourism or related facilities, tourism resources and services based on their target tourists in relation to the composition of the party with whom they travel and share the associated expenses."@en;  sh:path estur:travelUnit;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTravelUnitSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "travelUnit: The instance of Event has a travelUnit value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTravelUnitSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https: